{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>天文台於2026年11月13日上午11時45分發出特別天氣提示，提醒市民注意即將到來的天氣變化。隨著高空擾動靠近，本港今晚驟雨逐漸增多，局部地區可能出現狂風雷暴，風勢較大。市民進行戶外活動時需特別留意天氣變化，並採取必要的安全措施。\n</p>\n<p>明日初時雨勢頗大，建議市民避免前往低窪地區及遠足等戶外活動，以免受到惡劣天氣影響。隨著高空擾動逐漸遠離，明日日間驟雨將減少，天色有望好轉，下午部分時間或可見陽光。</p>\n<p>天文台呼籲市民密切留意最新天氣消息，並提前做好防範措施，以確保安全。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%96%87%e5%8f%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天文台</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e9%a0%90%e5%a0%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天氣預報</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%89%b9%e5%88%a5%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e6%8f%90%e7%a4%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">特別天氣提示</a> </p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 13 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T04:55:58.734419+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":271,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T04:30:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:10:26.539862+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T04:49:28.381939+00:00","content_hash":"67fcf1b607ff99828fc51eba8ce723185899ea19a6d4be04f02ed852a08873df","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}